# Raising the autosave delay in the settings window mid-session leaves the next change unsaved long enough that another program's edit opens the conflict prompt.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
END
keys g,
see Settings
keys /
type autosave
keys <Enter> <Enter>
see Autosave delay: 1000
keys <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS>
type 9000
keys <Enter> <Esc>
keys j x
see ✔ Write report
outside <<END
Work:
	- Write report
	- Review PRs
END
see Your changes are not saved yet.
keys t
see Review PRs
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report
	- Review PRs
END
